Root cause:
The root cause of the bug is the continued support and handling of the deprecated `dfs.umask` configuration key, which could lead to confusion and incorrect behavior when users attempt to set umask values. The presence of legacy code that checks for the old configuration and provides warnings may not effectively guide users to transition to the new configuration key, potentially resulting in misconfigured permissions.

