}
```
Reason:
By removing the handling of the deprecated `dfs.umask` key and throwing an exception if it is still set, the code enforces the use of the new configuration key. This change eliminates confusion and ensures that users are directed to use the current method for setting umask values, thereby preventing misconfigured permissions.


